---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="ab-vals">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px">
      <div class="eyebrow ctr">What Drives Us</div>
      <h2 class="st bl">Our Pillars</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-vg">
      <div class="ab-v">
        <div class="ab-v-icon">🎯</div>
        <div class="ab-v-title">Purpose</div>
        <p class="ab-v-body">
          We help veterans find meaningful direction after service — through volunteering,
          community, and programs designed for the next mission in life.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-v">
        <div class="ab-v-icon">🤝</div>
        <div class="ab-v-title">Community</div>
        <p class="ab-v-body">
          The bond service builds doesn't end at discharge. We keep it alive through events,
          retreats, and a community that shows up.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-v">
        <div class="ab-v-icon">🛡️</div>
        <div class="ab-v-title">Accountability</div>
        <p class="ab-v-body">
          We're Platinum Transparency rated because veterans deserve to know exactly where their
          trust — and donations — go.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      style="
          text-align: center;
          margin-top: 44px;
          display: flex;
          justify-content: center;
          gap: 14px;
        "
    >
      <a
        href="https://my.onecause.com/fundraiser/organizations/069c5aa7-32be-4377-be03-b101310beee7/fundraisers/fundraiser:fd94be2b-b4ba-4e2a-b112-1ae8d3c376ee"
        class="btn-r"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Donate Now</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
